All business data in this repository is synthetic. The companies, contacts,
deals, invoices, and support tickets are generated from a seeded manifest and do
not describe any real person or organization; this is enforced by an automated
repository hygiene test.

Third-party data:

The free-email provider domain list (warehouse/seeds/free_email_domains.csv)
is generated from the "free-email-domains" npm package,
Copyright (c) Kiko Beats (https://github.com/Kikobeats/free-email-domains),
licensed under the MIT License.

The ISO 4217 currency code list (vendor/iso-4217/list-one.xml, and the
artifacts generated from it: ingest/src/iso4217-codes.ts and
warehouse/seeds/iso_4217_currencies.csv) is published by SIX Group AG, the
ISO 4217 Maintenance Agency, at
https://www.six-group.com/en/products-services/financial-information/data-standards.html
(list-one.xml, Pblshd="2026-01-01"). It is factual reference data — currency
codes, names and minor units — reproduced unmodified with attribution.
Provenance and refresh procedure: vendor/iso-4217/README.md.
